  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As <math><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>the required area is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></munderover><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>"
